+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Commands
+
+* `init`: creates an analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports`: analyzes the code and generates the reports
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or updates a landscape report, aggregating results of multiple analyses (the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands)
+* `updateLandscape`: the same as `analyzeLandscape`, kept for existing scripts
+* `updateConfig`: updates an analysis configuration file
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the usage of a command.
\ No newline at end of file
